WEBVTT
NOTE English subtitles for Dear Monica (2024), translated from the film's own Chinese lines for the portfolio page. Placed above the burned-in Chinese.

00:00.500 --> 00:01.800 line:70%
Mum,

00:02.000 --> 00:04.200 line:70%
it's been a long time since I wrote to you.

00:04.500 --> 00:06.800 line:70%
I've been doing quite well lately.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.200 line:70%
Shanghai is so big.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.700 line:70%
Sometimes I get lost after a couple of steps.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.300 line:70%
A big city,

00:18.500 --> 00:21.200 line:70%
it's just different.

00:22.000 --> 00:22.800 line:70%
Mum,

00:23.000 --> 00:25.700 line:70%
I'm not lonely in Shanghai at all.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.700 line:70%
Wherever I want to go, there are plenty of friends to go with.

00:30.000 --> 00:32.200 line:70%
Everyone has so much character.

00:32.500 --> 00:34.300 line:70%
They're so interesting.

00:35.000 --> 00:35.800 line:70%
Mum,

00:36.000 --> 00:37.300 line:70%
don't worry.

00:37.500 --> 00:39.200 line:70%
Work is going well too.

00:39.500 --> 00:40.800 line:70%
The pay in Shanghai is really high.

00:41.000 --> 00:42.800 line:70%
And my boss is good to me.

00:45.500 --> 00:47.200 line:70%
Mum,

00:47.500 --> 00:49.700 line:70%
I'll work a little longer, then go to sleep.

00:50.000 --> 00:55.200 line:70%
Once I've saved the down payment and bought a flat,

00:55.500 --> 00:58.200 line:70%
we'll live in Shanghai together.
